#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/data-management.md:1
#: 120af0f93cc44f9b8605037d98669d4f
msgid "数据管理（Data Management）"
msgstr "Data Management"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/data-management.md:3
#: b320312714754e1aa6b20aaf7c8a63dd
msgid ""
"`Data Management` 用来记录项目、模型版本、数据路径和备注。它不负责生成结构，"
"也不负责训练； 它解决的是另一个问题：当你有很多轮 DFT、很多个 `nep.txt`、很多"
"个候选池和训练结果时， 还能知道每个文件属于哪一次实验。"
msgstr ""
"Use `Data Management` to record projects, model versions, data paths, and "
"notes. It neither generates structures nor trains models. Its purpose is to "
"preserve provenance when several DFT rounds, `nep.txt` files, candidate "
"pools, and training results accumulate."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/data-management.md:7
#: 94c8729112cd4ac8b0e52c76ee63cea4
msgid "什么时候值得用"
msgstr "When to use it"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/data-management.md:9
#: f3072b62386447faadab733f3f2d2823
msgid "下面这些情况建议开始记录："
msgstr "Start recording versions when any of the following applies:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/data-management.md:11
#: 74beff60769d41eda3711ca4e437b3a6
msgid "同一个材料体系已经做了多轮主动学习。"
msgstr ""
"The same material system has gone through several active-learning iterations."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/data-management.md:12
#: 4cddc0d9d3b24142888ec2d1a1baabac
msgid "每一轮都有候选结构、清洗结构、DFT 结果、训练模型和测试结果。"
msgstr ""
"Each iteration has its own candidate structures, cleaned structures, DFT "
"results, trained model, and test results."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/data-management.md:13
#: 00f157cf07b04897a7ce5d8086412793
msgid "你需要对比不同 `nep.txt` 的误差、备注和适用范围。"
msgstr ""
"You need to compare the errors, notes, and applicability of different "
"`nep.txt` files."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/data-management.md:14
#: 5f92466d68d64a4d8aa5550af3717040
msgid "你经常回头找“上次那个效果好的模型在哪个目录”。"
msgstr ""
"You often have to rediscover which directory contains a previously "
"successful model."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/data-management.md:16
#: 61f7648e83db4fd28e487128df854d56
msgid "如果只是临时试一张卡片，不一定需要马上建项目。"
msgstr ""
"A quick one-off card experiment does not necessarily need a project record."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/data-management.md:18
#: 3e2416a1e56f426c9de799449188e8f6
msgid "推荐记录方式"
msgstr "Recommended record structure"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/data-management.md:20
#: e9fb2a88a85643aabaad917ba96d414a
msgid ""
"可以按材料体系或研究主题建立 `Project`，再把每一轮模型作为 `Model(version)` "
"记录进去。"
msgstr ""
"Create a `Project` for a material system or research topic, then record each "
"model iteration as a `Model(version)`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/data-management.md:22
#: 0773692cbb6e41c7bc1e3462ca3e8dd9
msgid "一个常见结构是："
msgstr "A typical record looks like this:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/data-management.md:24
#: 6ef9b3da812b4477a207d10aeefb13be
msgid ""
"Project: TiH2 surface defects\n"
"  v001: 初始 bulk + surface 数据\n"
"  v002: 加入 vacancy / adsorbate 候选结构\n"
"  v003: 清洗后 FPS 采样并完成 DFT\n"
"  v004: 回看训练误差后补高力结构\n"
msgstr ""
"Project: TiH2 surface defects\n"
"  v001: initial bulk and surface data\n"
"  v002: add vacancy and adsorbate candidates\n"
"  v003: clean, sample with FPS, and complete DFT labels\n"
"  v004: inspect training errors and add high-force structures\n"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/data-management.md:32
#: c81180b545974dbe967e54c3655a2988
msgid "每个版本建议至少记录："
msgstr "Record at least the following for each version:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/data-management.md:34
#: 31a1fa257ffb4bc7b80f5b753f95a516
msgid "模型或结果目录路径。"
msgstr "The model or results directory."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/data-management.md:35
#: 069fc558de3949a7b7714ad00ac31df7
msgid "对应的训练集来源。"
msgstr "The source of the associated training set."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/data-management.md:36
#: a4d6c3f1c3ad43b6bdc23ceb381a0415
msgid "简短备注：这一轮补了什么结构、删了什么异常、模型适合什么范围。"
msgstr ""
"A short note describing which structures were added, which anomalies were "
"removed, and where the model is intended to be used."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/data-management.md:37
#: 37f8a7ba660843e7b8a9d270dbd965f3
msgid "标签：例如 `surface`、`defect`、`magnetic`、`failed`、`baseline`。"
msgstr "Tags such as `surface`, `defect`, `magnetic`, `failed`, or `baseline`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/data-management.md:39
#: ec588e5aa00d4c60b84a233566fd7572
msgid "和主流程的关系"
msgstr "Place in the main workflow"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/data-management.md:41
#: d2e9e5c114404a199e64017dd6adc0b6
msgid "`Data Management` 更适合放在每轮流程结束后使用："
msgstr "Use `Data Management` at the end of a meaningful iteration:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/data-management.md:43
#: c61c3d2b9b4b4ed69f2517a86675353f
msgid ""
"生成数据集 生成候选结构\n"
"-> NEP Dataset Display 清洗\n"
"-> DFT\n"
"-> GPUMD 训练\n"
"-> NEP Dataset Display 回看\n"
"-> Data Management 记录这一轮\n"
msgstr "Generate a dataset and candidate structures\n-> clean them in NEP Dataset Display\n-> DFT\n-> train with GPUMD\n-> review in NEP Dataset Display\n-> record the iteration in Data Management\n"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/data-management.md:52
#: 4356c896487d44718d78433de086aad9
msgid "这样记录的是已经有明确意义的版本，而不是每个临时文件。"
msgstr ""
"This keeps records at meaningful version boundaries instead of creating an "
"entry for every temporary file."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/data-management.md:54
#: deef561b00dc44dba2acf67c32abc590
msgid "常用操作"
msgstr "Common operations"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/data-management.md:56
#: 3b6901d8ead947b681dcdd494e5e76c0
msgid "新建、修改、删除 `Project`。"
msgstr "Create, edit, or delete a `Project`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/data-management.md:57
#: 94956082dc274c0bb285b9cfc9028d93
msgid "新建、修改、删除 `Model(version)`。"
msgstr "Create, edit, or delete a `Model(version)`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/data-management.md:58
#: 28901fd6c69c40e1b10a6d58cb315e3c
msgid "打开本地目录或 URL。"
msgstr "Open a local directory or URL."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/data-management.md:59
#: 2b480d34dc1f4a3c9b3fb9f7e1b1a020
msgid "用 `Ctrl+F` 搜索项目、标签、备注或路径。"
msgstr "Press `Ctrl+F` to search projects, tags, notes, or paths."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/data-management.md:61
#: 03be7031b9714ccda3b69945999cf05f
msgid ""
"选择 NEP 结果目录后，软件会尝试从 `energy_train.out`、`force_train.out` 和 "
"`virial_train.out` 计算训练 RMSE。某个输出缺失或列格式不完整时，会指出具体文"
"件并保留 当前手动输入值，不会把缺失结果当作零误差。"
msgstr ""
"After you select a NEP results directory, the application attempts to "
"calculate training RMSE from `energy_train.out`, `force_train.out`, and "
"`virial_train.out`. If an output is missing or its columns are incomplete, "
"the dialog identifies that file and preserves the current manual value "
"instead of treating the missing result as zero error."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/data-management.md:65
#: 95aa7241776348179fde25bb919fdc5d
msgid "存储位置"
msgstr "Storage location"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/data-management.md:67
#: 853fb5192cf840cfb03d40501fcb99a4
msgid "本地数据库默认放在用户配置目录："
msgstr ""
"The local database is stored in the user configuration directory by default:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/data-management.md:69
#: efb6aab5ceeb4edaac90d1585c8a2ab0
msgid "Windows：`C:\\Users\\<You>\\AppData\\Local\\NepTrainKit\\mlpman.db`"
msgstr "Windows：`C:\\Users\\<You>\\AppData\\Local\\NepTrainKit\\mlpman.db`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/data-management.md:70
#: 4c36db0aab37460688a420ddd0e6265f
msgid "Linux：`~/.config/NepTrainKit/mlpman.db`"
msgstr "Linux：`~/.config/NepTrainKit/mlpman.db`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/data-management.md:72
#: 7b8513dc21774f959ba3930155a40312
msgid ""
"这个数据库只记录管理信息，不会自动复制你的大体积训练数据。移动训练目录后，记"
"得更新记录里的路径。"
msgstr ""
"The database stores management metadata only; it does not copy large "
"training datasets. If a training directory moves, update its path in the "
"corresponding record."

